WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 size:84% position:42%
-You guys, this weekend
was St. Patrick's Day,

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, of course, there was
a big parade here in New York,

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a lot of men
were wearing kilts.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.578
It made the manspreading on the
subway even worse than normal.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Whoa!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.316
-Although in Washington,
the White House celebrated

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
by dyeing the fountain
on the South Lawn green...

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.520 size:84% position:42%
which backfired when
the President yelled...

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Imitates Trump ]
"Mountain Dew!"

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
And dove right in.
Nom nom nom! Om nom nom nom.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.127 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.763
Did you see -- did you see this?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's really a fan
of Mountain Dew.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Do the Dew!"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.568
Did you see this,
a meteorologist in Oklahoma City

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
tried to do an Irish jig.
Did you see this?

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:39.439 size:81% position:41% line:92%
For St. Patrick's Day?

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:43.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
When her co-anchor decided
to join in. Watch this.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:44.878 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Irish jig playing ]

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:49.282 size:84% position:42%
Here she comes. Yep.
Hey -- how you doing --

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.051 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:51.484 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Thud ]

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:52.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-That was a really good fall.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:56.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, oh, oh.
That's a good fall.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
-Wow!

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:01.528
-"Today's high is 45 and the low
is...my co-anchor. Hey, Steven!"

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"My back! My back!"
-"I can't feel my legs!"

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-What was he --

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.536
I don't know what he was doing.
-Oh, my God! [ Laughs ]

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:13.206
-Let's get to some news here.
It just came out, you guys,

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.509
that Trump's Secretary of State,
Rex Tillerson, was on the toilet

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.412 size:84% position:42%
when he found out Trump
fired him on Twitter.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Then Trump said...

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Imitates Trump ]
"Well, what a coincidence.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was on the toilet when I
tweeted that.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:27.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
So basically, we talked
to each other."

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:33.026
That's right. Tillerson was on
the toilet when he was fired,

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.995
which explains why Jeff Sessions
and Betsy DeVos haven't used

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
the bathroom in six months.
They're like,

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:42.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Unh-unh. No way, man."
[ Grunting ]

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.671
"Unh-unh, I'm not gonna --
hold it in, hold it in."

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:49.542
Oh, and the Russian presidential
election was this weekend.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:52.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I saw that --
yeah, Putin won.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.813 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.516
To get people to vote, Russian
officials were offering prizes

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.717 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
like Apple watches.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:59.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sounds fun until you open
the box with your Apple watch

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's still attached
to a hand.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you go, "oh, this is--"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Still works."

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:09.596 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:11.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
Still has a pulse.
-Yeah.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:11.898 line:92%
-That's interesting, yeah.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:16.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
The big story still
is March Madness. Right now...

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:17.837 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:19.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
The tournament has been crazy
so far.

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:22.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
The other night, a 16th seed
beat a number 1 seed

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:26.346 size:88% position:44%
for the first time ever,
when UMBC beat Virginia.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ow!
-That's right.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.517 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:32.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's pretty nuts.
Until last weekend,

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:36.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
everyone thought UMBC was
a bank. And you...oh.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:36.689 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.225
Some more sports news, golfer
Rory McIlroy says there should

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:42.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
be a limit to how much alcohol
fans can buy at events,

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:45.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they're getting
too rowdy.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also, he's tired of hearing
drunk people

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.035 line:92%
try to say "Rory McIlroy."

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:52.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
[ Slurring ] "Rory McIlroy."

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.706 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Rory McIlroy."

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:56.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ]
Like Tom Brokaw, yeah.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.311 line:92%
[ Slurring ] "Rory McIlroy.

00:02:58.311 --> 00:02:59.913 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:06.719 size:84% position:42%
Rory McIlroy -- Rory --
R-R-R-Rory McIlroy."

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.621
[ Laughter ]
[ Normal voice ] Get this, guys.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.090 size:81% position:41%
Engineers have crafted
a futuristic jetpack

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:14.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
that lets you fly up
to 10,000 feet in the air.

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:15.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience oohs ]
It even has a cool name.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:20.400
It's called "You Try It First."
Yeah. Kind of an odd thing.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.267 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.269
And finally, I read about a man
in Ohio who just ended

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:27.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
his streak of eating Chipotle
for 500 straight days.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience ohs ]
When asked why he decided

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
