"oh, he died."

00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:33.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
We have a great show tonight.

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for The Roots,
everybody!

